# Citation metadata for Corvus. GitHub renders this file as "Cite this repository".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Corvus in research or in a publication, cite it with this metadata."
title: "Corvus"
abstract: "Corvus is a local browser hub for AI agents. A Rust daemon serves the Model Context Protocol over stdio and streamable HTTP, a Manifest V3 extension connects the browser the user already runs, and an optional browser-level CDP channel drives a browser started with remote debugging on loopback. The daemon exposes 43 tools for perception, action, network control, session recording, replay and diagnostics, and records every call to a local SQLite session store."
